From: verkur46 <mohamadrezasahami1999@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 12:54:57 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 127/230] Fix date strip: Persian day abbreviations from single
 letters to readable 3-letter forms
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Persian dates.day.* values changed from single letters (د س چ پ ج ش ی)
  to readable 3-letter forms (دو سه چه پن جمع شن یک) so each chip is
  understandable in FA mode, matching the 3-letter rhythm of the English
  Mon/Tue/Wed/Thu/Fri/Sat/Sun labels.
- DateStrip chip gap reduced gap-1.5 → gap-1 so all five chips fit on one
  row at 390px without horizontal scroll when showing the longer Persian text.

🤖 Generated with Codebuff
Co-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>
